WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.102
Fred Pleitgen is OUTFRONT in Kiev.

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.636
And Fred, air raid sirens,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.105
they were going off earlier today.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.673
No surprise given what's been going on.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:10.176
But what is it been like on the ground

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:11.144
either, Pamela?

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.013
Well, there were some pretty severe drone

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.881
and missile attacks by the Russians,

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.384
and they pretty much came in two waves.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.686
One was overnight using cruise missiles

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.286
and drones.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.088
And the Ukrainians say their air defenses

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:22.922
managed to actually shoot

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:23.790
most of those down.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.458
And then later in the morning,

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.494
there were ballistic missile attacks.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.029
And the Ukrainians actually said of

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.697
11 ballistic missiles shot

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:31.931
at the capital Kiev.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:32.565
They managed to take

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.800
all of those out now.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.502
Nevertheless, of course, for the folks

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:36.669
who live in the city,

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.004
there were some seriously

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.005
frightening moments.

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:41.541
Here's what happened.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:44.911
Terrified children

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.746
running for their lives as Russia

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.182
unleashed another massive aerial attack

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:50.950
on Ukrainian cities.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.285
But Ukraine says its air

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.086
defense managed

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.054
to shoot down

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.488
all the ballistic missiles

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.424
fired at the capital, Kiev.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.225
And now Ukraine's forces

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.261
seem nearly ready for their own

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:05.231
much anticipated counter offensive.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:06.399
This weekend,

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.400
Ukraine's top

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.135
general, Valery Zelazny,

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.703
releasing this video

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.739
showing troops gearing up for battle

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.408
and showcasing modern western weapons

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.843
with a clear message.

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:20.680
It's time to take back what's our income.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:23.550
We're building a slim.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:26.453
And that's what these guys

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:27.487
are training for.

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:29.589
This is the unit of the offensive guard

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.658
in Ukraine, interior ministry.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.394
We have a clear motivation.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.696
The commander says we defend our land.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.731
This is our nation, our homeland.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.167
The offensive guard is mustering

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.669
tens of thousands of troops,

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:43.436
they say,

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.138
training to storm trenches

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.307
and evacuate casualties,

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.074
which they know

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.109
they're bound to have

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.844
in the tough battles ahead.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.011
But these guys are practicing here.

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.580
No doubt will become a reality

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.048
for the Ukrainian armed forces

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.883
very soon, as Kiev says

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.185
it will start a massive counter offensive

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.287
to take back all of their territory,

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.822
including Crimea.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:04.190
The Ukrainians already seem

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.158
to be stepping up

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:07.560
strikes on possible Russian supply lines

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.062
in occupied areas.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:09.896
Russian installed

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:10.730
officials claiming

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.432
Ukrainian missile attacks

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:13.633
against targets around

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.502
Berdyansk and Mariupol

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:17.704
in southeastern Ukraine in the past days.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:20.473
That is to say, it's just the beginning.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:21.875
A top adviser to Ukraine's

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.676
presidency tells me so.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.744
With everything

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:25.445
that is happening

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:28.047
now as a precursor for a counterattack,

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:29.883
a necessary precursor

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:32.185
where the intensity of fire increases.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.920
While for us he's calm

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:34.921
and he lays out

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.990
bold aims for the counter offensive

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:38.491
the are online.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:40.059
It will end undoubtedly

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:41.494
on the borders of Ukraine

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:42.061
as they were

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:45.598
in 1991 with the occupation of Crimea

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.066
and with the beginning

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.202
of a massive process of transformation

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:51.037
of Russia's political system.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:52.739
But for now,

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:53.973
resilience remains

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.342
key for the people in Ukraine's cities.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.244
These newlyweds had just tied

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:58.711
the knot

00:02:58.711 --> 00:02:59.646
and were on their way

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:00.780
to their celebration

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.183
when the air raid sirens went off.

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.450
So they just continue

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.252
to celebrate in the bomb shelter,

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.521
vowing not to let Russian rockets ruin

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:13.526
the best day of their lives.

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:14.260
And, you know, Pamela,

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:14.727
that's really

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.529
the resilience that we see

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.765
from a lot of people here in Kiev.

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:19.499
Of course,

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:21.067
when the sirens go off, the folks,

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.835
they do run to the shelters.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.003
They run for cover.

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:25.438
However, they emerge pretty quickly

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:27.040
after the all clear comes in

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.408
and they go about their daily

00:03:28.408 --> 00:03:30.143
lives, they go straight back to work.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.077
And one of the things

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:31.945
that the head of Ukraine's

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:33.780
military intelligence said today

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.514
is he said, look,

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.748
if the Russians believe

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.784
they can scare the people in Ukraine

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:39.152
and in Kiev specifically,

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:42.722
they certainly are mistaken Pamela.

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.490
Well, thank you, Fred.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.091
For now,

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:46.526
former Russian Prime Minister

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:48.261
Mikhail Kasyanov.

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.562
He served as prime minister

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.697
when Vladimir Putin first

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:51.631
became president.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.132
Thank you for joining us tonight.

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.268
You worked alongside Putin

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.003
for a number of years.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:59.138
When you see this new massive

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.073
assault of missiles

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.108
by Russia into Ukraine,

00:04:02.108 --> 00:04:03.543
what do you think Putin

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:05.011
is trying to do right now?

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:07.113
I think Mr.

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:07.880
Putin and

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:08.982
his inner circle,

00:04:08.982 --> 00:04:10.650
they are demonstrating

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.452
very nervous nervousness.

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.187
They're expecting

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:16.656
a Ukrainian counteroffensive operation

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:17.991
and they're nervous about that,

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:19.492
that they're trying to somehow

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:21.561
to prevent on to two

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:23.630
or to make it more difficult, etc..

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.999
But of course, these atrocities

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.300
just continue to take place.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.234
And people,

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:29.535
people all over the world

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:31.404
already just cannot

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:32.672
keep patience on that.

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:33.539
And everyone

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:35.875
just in the West and the we hope

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:37.043
the Russian Democrats

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:40.446
also expecting just success of Ukrainian

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:42.815
upcoming counteroffensive operation

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:44.851
in Ukraine, meantime, appears

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:45.952
to be stepping up attacks

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:47.587
in Russian occupied territories.

00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:49.722
We have seen a number of attacks

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:52.625
by pro-Ukrainian groups inside Russia.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:53.926
What impact do

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.995
those attacks have on Putin

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:58.865
and the Russian public?

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:01.334
I think, of course, it's not obviously

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.236
admitted by Ukrainian government

00:05:03.236 --> 00:05:04.637
that they involved on these,

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:05.905
but these

00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:08.041
these of course, operations

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.709
on the territory of Russia,

00:05:09.709 --> 00:05:10.243
of course,

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:11.477
demonstrate hitting

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:14.414
some kind of a weakness of border

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:16.015
border control of Russia

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:17.550
or Russian authorities,

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:20.586
and of course, creating some kind of fear

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:24.390
among them on Russia, on Russian army

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.558
and population

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:27.760
and also administrations on those regions

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:28.928
and Kremlin.

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.563
That is the most important thing.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:31.831
Just as a demonstration

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.833
that Russia is not protected

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.002
so much as Putin just declared

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:39.372
for decades, that security and stability

00:05:39.372 --> 00:05:40.506
is the major

00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:42.809
the major point for and his strategy.

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:44.110
But right now,

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.712
just this demonstration

00:05:45.712 --> 00:05:47.580
that it's not the case.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.781
Do you see a point

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:50.383
at which Putin will be willing

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:54.687
to negotiate in good faith?

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:55.355
In good faith.

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:57.323
It's interesting expression

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:57.957
of good faith.

00:05:57.957 --> 00:06:00.059
But we don't want to negotiate right now.

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:01.794
But he doesn't want to

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:02.528
to talk

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:03.863
to withdraw troops

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:05.131
from occupied territories.

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:06.499
He wants to stop.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:09.602
He needs the ceasefire so that to

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:13.806
restructure the army and economy

00:06:14.574 --> 00:06:15.975
facing problems.

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:17.377
Let's just take a step back for a second.

00:06:17.377 --> 00:06:18.378
I mean, when you look at

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:19.979
and listen to Putin now,

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:20.913
how is he different,

00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:22.081
if at all, from the person

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:23.549
that you worked with back

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:25.118
in the early 2000?

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:27.186
Oh, absolutely.

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:28.821
That's it's completely different person

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:29.822
at that time

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:32.325
when when we worked together on the first

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:33.192
his charm,

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:34.627
he promised to me

00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:36.929
and to all the team of my Cabinet

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:38.564
that he would support

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:39.766
all the all the reforms.

00:06:39.766 --> 00:06:40.767
And, in fact,

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:42.835
he implemented this promise.

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:43.903
But the exclusion

00:06:43.903 --> 00:06:45.037
of tour reforms,

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:46.506
he didn't allow me

00:06:46.506 --> 00:06:48.641
to undertake administrative reform,

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:49.442
which means

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:51.210
reduction of state involvement

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.212
in the economy, in the public life, etc..

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:56.382
And he didn't allow me to to pursue.

00:06:56.649 --> 00:06:58.651
But this your gas sector reform.

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:00.620
It means just to

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.388
destroy Gazprom monopoly

00:07:02.388 --> 00:07:03.890
for gas supplies.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:07.360
But at that time, we no way

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:07.994
I understand

00:07:07.994 --> 00:07:09.061
he pretended

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:11.397
to be a democratically devoted person,

00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:14.467
but in fact, he was always a KGB agent.

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:15.134
Right now,

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:18.271
he performs as he is a natural person.

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:19.739
Putin's KGB

00:07:19.739 --> 00:07:21.541
agent with absolute death,

00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:23.609
distorted worldview.

00:07:23.609 --> 00:07:23.943
All right.

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.278
Thank you so much for your time.

00:07:25.278 --> 00:07:27.380
We appreciate it. Thank you.

00:07:28.948 --> 00:07:30.817
And OUTFRONT now, retired Army Lieutenant

00:07:30.817 --> 00:07:32.318
General Mark Hertling, former

00:07:32.318 --> 00:07:33.853
commanding general of Europe

00:07:33.853 --> 00:07:34.854
and the seventh Army.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:36.122
So you just heard there

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:38.224
from the former prime minister Kasyanov,

00:07:38.224 --> 00:07:39.725
saying that those massive strikes

00:07:39.725 --> 00:07:40.460
overnight show

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.461
how nervous Putin

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:43.262
and his inner circle are about this

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:44.630
coming offensive.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.365
From a military standpoint,

00:07:46.365 --> 00:07:47.333
what would Russia

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:49.802
be trying to do with those strikes?

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:52.672
And they're trying to interfere

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:54.207
with the connection

00:07:54.207 --> 00:07:55.541
between the political body

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:56.943
and the decision makers

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.578
in the key government.

00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:01.013
President Olinsky, with his field

00:08:01.347 --> 00:08:03.683
generals, General Zalewski,

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.751
they have developed a plan.

00:08:05.751 --> 00:08:06.953
There has been messaging

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:08.221
on the Internet today

00:08:08.221 --> 00:08:09.088
saying that

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:10.690
that President Zelensky

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.391
has approved that plan.

00:08:12.391 --> 00:08:14.060
Now, I think Russia is really

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:14.827
it's not just

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:15.995
going after Ukraine,

00:08:15.995 --> 00:08:17.363
as the former prime

00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:18.831
minister has now said,

00:08:18.831 --> 00:08:20.733
it's more to try and interfere

00:08:20.733 --> 00:08:22.768
with the command and control structure

00:08:23.002 --> 00:08:24.971
between the political leaders in Kiev

00:08:24.971 --> 00:08:26.706
and the frontline generals

00:08:26.706 --> 00:08:29.141
of all along the front line.

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:30.243
And there's a reporting out there

00:08:30.243 --> 00:08:31.010
that we talked about earlier

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.011
in the show where

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:32.912
some of these

00:08:32.912 --> 00:08:33.946
the missiles are using

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.648
or millions of dollars a piece.

00:08:35.648 --> 00:08:36.816
I mean, this is precious

00:08:36.816 --> 00:08:38.384
arsenal for Russia.

00:08:38.384 --> 00:08:39.352
What do you make of that?

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:42.288
Well, it certainly is for Russia.

00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:43.356
And they are running out

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:44.190
of these missiles.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.558
But there have been reports

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:46.492
that they've been running out

00:08:46.492 --> 00:08:47.360
for a long time.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.461
You happen to mention

00:08:48.461 --> 00:08:50.162
that some of these Russian missiles

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:51.697
cost millions of dollars.

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:53.065
The missiles that shoot them

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:54.600
down, the Patriot missiles

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.635
also cost

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:56.736
millions of dollars

00:08:56.736 --> 00:08:58.771
between three and 4 million a copy.

00:08:58.771 --> 00:09:01.474
So it really is a race to logistics,

00:09:01.474 --> 00:09:03.743
a race to technological advantage.

00:09:03.943 --> 00:09:05.845
And I think what happened last night

00:09:05.845 --> 00:09:07.413
with the drone strikes

00:09:07.413 --> 00:09:08.247
accompanying missile

00:09:08.247 --> 00:09:09.148
strikes in the evening

00:09:09.148 --> 00:09:09.749
and then further

00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:11.384
ballistic missiles during the day.

00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:12.652
Again, it's Russia

00:09:12.652 --> 00:09:15.254
attempting to attempt to to template

00:09:15.488 --> 00:09:16.789
what Ukraine is doing

00:09:16.789 --> 00:09:18.291
in their defensive positions

00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:20.326
and then trying to get the faster

00:09:20.326 --> 00:09:21.060
moving missiles,

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.295
the more damaging missiles

00:09:22.295 --> 00:09:23.729
into the capital city.

00:09:23.729 --> 00:09:25.197
So it's a tactic

00:09:25.197 --> 00:09:25.865
of, you know,

00:09:25.865 --> 00:09:28.200
we're hearing reports of 90 missiles

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.101
or whatever.

00:09:29.101 --> 00:09:30.903
But the way they're being

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:33.139
shot into the different locations

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:33.940
in Ukraine,

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.474
Russia is attempting to interfere

00:09:35.474 --> 00:09:36.075
with manning

00:09:36.075 --> 00:09:37.243
control structure

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:38.911
as well as troop movements

00:09:38.911 --> 00:09:39.912
within Ukraine.

00:09:39.912 --> 00:09:41.714
So it is a back and forth

00:09:41.714 --> 00:09:42.882
and it can't just be the

00:09:42.882 --> 00:09:44.317
the big tactic of,

00:09:44.317 --> 00:09:46.118
hey, we're shooting a lot of missiles.

00:09:46.118 --> 00:09:46.886
It's really interesting

00:09:46.886 --> 00:09:47.820
with the Patriot missiles

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:48.955
because as you'll recall,

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:49.789
there was so much back

00:09:49.789 --> 00:09:51.457
and forth and reluctance

00:09:51.457 --> 00:09:52.592
from the Biden administration

00:09:52.592 --> 00:09:54.360
to send the Patriot missiles.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.329
Now they're over there, as Wolinsky says.

00:09:56.329 --> 00:09:57.129
They're using them

00:09:57.129 --> 00:09:58.731
and they're saving lives.

00:09:58.731 --> 00:10:00.933
If you had a bird's eye view of Ukraine,

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:01.634
what clues

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:03.469
would you be looking for to see if

00:10:03.469 --> 00:10:05.671
Ukraine was about to start its offensive?

00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:07.440
Well, you know,

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.908
there's a strategic objective

00:10:08.908 --> 00:10:10.309
that President Olinsky has,

00:10:10.309 --> 00:10:10.810
and he has

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:12.979
given that to his military commanders.

00:10:13.145 --> 00:10:14.013
And over the last

00:10:14.013 --> 00:10:15.615
several months and weeks,

00:10:15.615 --> 00:10:17.516
they have been shaping the battlefield.

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:18.651
We've used that term

00:10:18.651 --> 00:10:19.952
multiple times on here.

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.954
Now it's time for the military commanders

00:10:21.954 --> 00:10:23.222
to come back to the president

00:10:23.222 --> 00:10:24.423
and say, hey, look, boss,

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:26.492
we have looked at the battlefield.

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:28.260
Here's where the Russians are weak.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.096
Here's where we need to be strong.

00:10:30.096 --> 00:10:32.264
Let's start moving forces from there.

00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:33.699
There are longer areas

00:10:33.699 --> 00:10:35.368
in the rear of Ukraine

00:10:35.368 --> 00:10:37.169
into their attack positions.

00:10:37.169 --> 00:10:38.404
So I think what we're going to see

00:10:38.404 --> 00:10:39.572
in the next couple of days

00:10:39.572 --> 00:10:40.206
and weeks

00:10:40.206 --> 00:10:43.042
is a lot of movement of Ukrainian forces.

00:10:43.542 --> 00:10:44.910
They are going to try and hide

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.545
that movement the best they can.

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:47.446
And at the same time,

00:10:47.446 --> 00:10:49.515
they're going to try and deceive Russia

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:50.816
for where they are going

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:52.251
and what axis of advance

00:10:52.251 --> 00:10:53.285
they're going to use.

00:10:53.285 --> 00:10:54.053
So a lot of this,

00:10:54.053 --> 00:10:56.222
Pamela, is a lot like a chessboard.

00:10:56.222 --> 00:10:57.723
Both sides are playing chess.

00:10:57.723 --> 00:10:59.258
They're trying to beat the other one

00:10:59.258 --> 00:11:00.693
to get to the right position

00:11:00.693 --> 00:11:02.762
so they can conduct the kind of offensive

00:11:02.762 --> 00:11:04.363
and defensive operations they need.

